---
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Layout>
<main class="config-page"><p class="eyebrow">CONFIGURE / 01—04</p><h1>Build an<br /><em>object.</em></h1><p class="intro">Begin with your vehicle. Select the marque, model, generation and position, then continue into material and personalisation.</p><div class="workspace"><div class="preview"><img src="/images/craft-x-works.svg" alt="Craft X emblem study" /><span>YOUR CRAFT X</span></div><form class="panel"><label>01 / MARQUE<select><option>Select a marque</option><option>BMW</option><option>Mercedes-Benz</option><option>Porsche</option><option>Land Rover</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label>02 / MODEL<input placeholder="Model name" /></label><label>03 / GENERATION / YEAR<input placeholder="Generation or model year" /></label><label>04 / POSITION<select><option>Front grille</option><option>Rear</option><option>Steering wheel</option><option>Wheel centre</option><option>Other</option></select></label><a href="/signature" class="next">CONTINUE TO PERSONALISATION <span>↗</span></a></form></div></main>
</Layout>
<style>
:global(body){background:#f2f0ea;color:#171717;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}.config-page{padding:150px 7vw 12vw}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.5}.config-page h1{font-size:clamp(68px,10vw,145px);font-weight:300;line-height:.82;letter-spacing:-.07em;margin:70px 0 30px}.config-page h1 em{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400}.intro{font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.6;max-width:500px}.workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:8vw;margin-top:10vw}.preview{min-height:600px;background:#858585;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.preview img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.preview span{position:absolute;left:22px;bottom:20px;color:#fff;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-shadow:0 2px 12px #000}.panel{border-top:1px solid #aaa}.panel label{display:block;padding:25px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #b8b4ab;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.16em}.panel select,.panel input{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #888;background:transparent;padding:18px 0 12px;font-size:18px;outline:none}.next{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #171717;padding:25px 0;margin-top:35px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em}.next span{font-size:16px}@media(max-width:768px){.config-page{padding:110px 7vw 20vw}.workspace{grid-template-columns:1fr;margin-top:18vw;gap:45px}.preview{min-height:88vw}}
</style>